{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"BIT-kyverno-2026-122306","published":"2026-11-17T11:49:08.433Z","modified":"2026-11-17T13:41:13.630239470Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-122306","GHSA-8mrj-27wr-599g"],"summary":"Kyverno before 1.19.2 Denial of Service via Exponential-Time Wildcard Matching","details":"Kyverno before 1.19.2 contains a denial of service vulnerability that allows namespaced policy authors to exhaust admission controller CPU by submitting pathological wildcard patterns. Attackers can create a Policy with crafted match and exclude names evaluated by ValidateMatchExcludeConflict, pinning cores and causing cluster-wide webhook timeouts that block resource operations.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kyverno","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/kyverno"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.19.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/kyverno/BIT-kyverno-2026-122306.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:H/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/kyverno/kyverno/security/advisories/GHSA-8mrj-27wr-599g"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-122306"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/kyverno-before-1.19.2-denial-of-service-via-exponential-time-wildcard-matching"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:kyverno:kyverno:*:*:*:*:*:go:*:*"],"severity":"High"}}